WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.190
Unit sixteen. Mosquitoes!

2
00:00:04.164 --> 00:00:07.915
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.965 --> 00:00:11.189
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.239 --> 00:00:14.593
Today we learn about Mosquitoes. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.596 --> 00:00:18.946
Mosquito. Say it with me. Mosquito!

6
00:00:22.451 --> 00:00:25.601
Net. Say it with me. Net!

7
00:00:29.088 --> 00:00:32.521
Bite. Say it with me. Bite!

8
00:00:36.019 --> 00:00:39.336
Water. Say it with me. Water!

9
00:00:42.837 --> 00:00:46.321
Cover. Say it with me. Cover!

10
00:00:49.804 --> 00:00:53.037
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

11
00:00:56.555 --> 00:00:59.871
Dengue. Say it with me. Dengue!

12
00:01:03.391 --> 00:01:06.758
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

13
00:01:10.242 --> 00:01:19.529
Mosquitoes can bite and spread sickness like dengue. I sleep under a net and wear clothes that cover my arms and legs. We cover water jars so mosquitoes cannot lay eggs.

14
00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.729
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.065 --> 00:01:27.487
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.537 --> 00:01:28.687
Bite!

17
00:01:29.397 --> 00:01:34.433
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.483 --> 00:01:35.633
Dengue!

19
00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:43.028
Did you know? Mosquitoes lay their eggs in still water, so covering water jars helps stop them!

20
00:01:43.078 --> 00:01:45.100
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.798 --> 00:01:53.654
Think and answer. How can you stop mosquitoes from biting you?

22
00:01:53.704 --> 00:01:54.854
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.070 --> 00:02:01.218
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.268 --> 00:02:03.999
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

